{
  "duration": 57.72,
  "match": 1.0,
  "lines": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "Tesla's flying car has no price.",
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 2.48,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "It's not there to be bought.",
      "start": 2.52,
      "end": 4.24,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "This month, Tesla showed three versions of its new Roadster.",
      "start": 4.453,
      "end": 7.92,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "Performance, the one that just drives.",
      "start": 8.24,
      "end": 10.24,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "$50,000 just to reserve one.",
      "start": 10.28,
      "end": 13.04,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "Thrust, the one with rocket thrusters.",
      "start": 13.08,
      "end": 15.44,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "$250,000 to reserve.",
      "start": 15.52,
      "end": 18.16,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "And Rocket, the one that flies.",
      "start": 18.366,
      "end": 20.56,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "Invite only.",
      "start": 20.8,
      "end": 21.92,
      "matched": "2/2"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "Here's the trick.",
      "start": 22.0,
      "end": 22.96,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "Almost nobody will ever own the one that flies.",
      "start": 23.2,
      "end": 26.0,
      "matched": "9/9"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "But it does two jobs.",
      "start": 26.08,
      "end": 27.84,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "First, it gets filmed.",
      "start": 28.173,
      "end": 29.52,
      "matched": "4/4"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "A car jumping over a Cybertruck gets more attention than any ad Tesla could buy.",
      "start": 29.56,
      "end": 34.32,
      "matched": "15/15"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "Second, it moves the anchor.",
      "start": 34.4,
      "end": 36.4,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "Next to a car that flies, $50,000 for one that drives sounds almost sensible.",
      "start": 37.2,
      "end": 42.4,
      "matched": "14/14"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "That's why menus put one crazy expensive dish right at the top.",
      "start": 42.44,
      "end": 46.4,
      "matched": "12/12"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "So if you sell anything, add one wild option above your best seller.",
      "start": 46.48,
      "end": 50.64,
      "matched": "13/13"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "Hardly anyone will pick it.",
      "start": 50.72,
      "end": 52.24,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "It's there to sell the one below it.",
      "start": 52.373,
      "end": 54.12,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "Send this to the friend who only has one price.",
      "start": 54.4,
      "end": 57.12,
      "matched": "10/10"
    }
  ],
